pythonSynopsis: sim.setShapeMaterial(int shapeHandle,int materialIdOrShapeHandle)
inputs (possibly taken/adapted from C-function counterpart. Adjust accordingly):
1. shapeHandle: the handle of the shape. See also sim.getObject.
2. materialIdOrShapeHandle: a predefined dynamic material ID, or the handle of another shape you wish to copy the material properties from.
